        "limitations": [
          "TASK and the original public source do not establish that departure must flush pending edits before returning. Buffer independence establishes ownership, not a departure deadline.",
          "Attempts 1 and 2 supply implementation examples and reported observations; their outcomes do not establish business requirements, causality, or cross-task effectiveness.",
